[length:03:20]
[ti:Grey eyes]
[ar:Aracne Phobia]
[al:Alignment: chaotic-dysfunctional]
[au:Aracne Phobia]
[lr:Aracne Phobia]
[by:Azaria]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.2.4]
[00:01.556]She’s fine
[00:06.112]She’s always fine
[00:09.571]Look at her—
[00:11.828]big grey eyes, perfect smile
[00:18.299]She was the prodigy
[00:19.280]quiet and bright
[00:20.720]read all the endings
[00:21.740]before they were right
[00:23.95]Spoke to the pages
[00:24.257]more than to friends
[00:25.653]lived in the margins
[00:26.550]where silence extends
[00:28.248]Big grey eyes
[00:29.187]they shimmer, they lie
[00:30.488]she learned very early
[00:31.651]which parts to hide
[00:33.06]They say she’s lovely
[00:34.216]they say she’s rare
[00:35.619]no one gets close enough
[00:36.876]to see she’s aware
[00:38.968]She laughs on cue
[00:40.836]tilts her head just right
[00:43.501]she clocks every pattern
[00:45.639]but still plays it nice
[00:48.293]If she feels too much
[00:50.532]she renames the pain
[00:53.564]calls it “a phase”
[00:55.722]just to stay the same
[00:58.155]She smiles like nothing’s wrong
[01:01.717]like she belongs somewhere
[01:04.102]But she’s drifting through the room
[01:06.179]like nobody put her there
[01:09.91]Shining girl, don’t break the scene
[01:11.226]keep it soft, keep it clean
[01:13.721]She knows exactly what this is—
[01:16.101]but she can’t exit the machine
[01:18.834]♫
[01:23.70]She talks to cats
[01:24.168]like they understand
[01:25.625]they never ask her
[01:26.742]to become a plan
[01:28.146]She slows it down
[01:29.315]blurs out the sound
[01:30.484]needs something soft
[01:31.510]to not hit the ground
[01:33.983]Too much feeling
[01:35.52]under her skin
[01:36.170]she maps the damage
[01:37.477]but won’t give in
[01:39.00]She reads herself
[01:40.170]in every word
[01:41.190]but understanding
[01:42.543]just makes it worse
[01:44.162]They love her face
[01:45.702]they love her voice
[01:48.186]they love the version
[01:50.858]that makes less noise
[01:54.26]She feeds them lines
[01:56.33]she wrote alone
[01:58.369]a perfect mask
[02:00.796]that feels like home
[02:03.270]She smiles like nothing’s wrong
[02:06.744]like she’s already saved
[02:09.170]But she’s fading in plain sight
[02:11.36]like a role she learned to play
[02:14.31]Shining girl, don’t lose control
[02:16.511]keep the script, protect the role
[02:18.762]If she questions what she is
[02:20.949]there’s no one left to hold
[02:24.592]She says:
[02:26.509]“You don’t want to be like me”
[02:30.814]“I see it all before it hits
[02:32.880]I know exactly where this leads”
[02:35.504]“I built a cage that looks like grace
[02:40.110]and now I live inside the theme”
[02:44.374]“But if I drop it—
[02:45.770]there is nothing underneath”
[02:49.445]She’s fine
[02:53.370]She’s always fine
[02:56.770]Big grey eyes
[02:58.685]open wide
[03:00.512]She feels too much
[03:03.78]to ever stop
[03:05.481]So she just learns
[03:07.445]to call it life
[03:10.41]♫
